A comprehensive AI-powered legal assistant for Vietnamese law, utilizing data from the Vietnamese Legal Code. This project helps users easily search and understand legal regulations through a user-friendly chat interface.

## Introduction

**Vietnamese-Law-Assistant-Chatbot-using-Graph-and-RAG** is a project developed by **Team CuliData**, designed to help users in Vietnam quickly and accurately search and consult legal information.

### Our Objectives:
- Provide accurate legal information based on legal texts in the legal code (focusing on social order and safety)
- Help users search and understand laws related to their issues
- Enhance legal accessibility through AI technology

## Features

- Data crawling and storage from the Vietnamese Legal Code
- Intelligent legal information search using vector similarity
- Automated question answering using Large Language Models (LLM)
- Vietnamese language support
- User-friendly web interface
- Topic, section, and chapter-based search
- Display of related legal articles
- Advanced search with filters
- Export search results as PDF

