lesson_5.py,lesson_5.py,1d40468dd26e0eb0140474923051c776baccc947,AniketKul/langchain-for-llms,https://api.github.com/repositories/873208496/contents/lesson_5.py?ref=2d5ff643209bf059c47fbda9972817da5431996d,https://api.github.com/repositories/873208496/git/blobs/1d40468dd26e0eb0140474923051c776baccc947,https://github.com/AniketKul/langchain-for-llms/blob/2d5ff643209bf059c47fbda9972817da5431996d/lesson_5.py,https://www.deeplearning.ai/short-courses/langchain-for-llm-application-development,,0,0,0,6,2024-10-15T23:18:15Z,0,0,"# LangChain for LLM Application Development

https://www.deeplearning.ai/short-courses/langchain-for-llm-application-development

- open-source development framework for LLM applications
- Key value adds:

1] Modular Components
2] Use Cases: Common ways to combine components

## LangChain Components

- Models:
    - LLMs: 20+ integrations
    - Chat Models
    - Text Embedding Models: 10+ integrations

- Prompts
    - Prompt Templates
    - Output Parsers: 5+ implementations
        - Retry/fixing logic
    - Example Selectors: 5+ implementations

- Indexes
    - Document Loaders: 50+ implementations
    - Text Splitters: 10+ implementations
    - Vector Stores: 10+ implementations
    - Retrievers: 5+ integrations/implementations

- Chains
    - Prompt + LLM + Output parsing
    - Can be used as building blocks for longer chains
    - More application specific chains: 20+ types

- Agents
    - Agent Types: 5+ types
        - Algorithms for getting LLMs to use tools
    - Agent Toolkits: 10+ implementations
        - Agents armed with specific tools for a specific application


