- [bigcode/santacoder](https://huggingface.co/bigcode/santacoder)
- [Salesforce/codegen2-1B](https://huggingface.co/Salesforce/codegen2-1B)
- [Salesforce/codegen2-3_7B](https://huggingface.co/Salesforce/codegen2-3_7B)
