logging_config.py,src/streaming/logging_config.py,053dd4d34eb0957c7dc6a2c991a6780452dc39e2,JugalBili/speech-to-speech,https://api.github.com/repositories/1029766819/contents/src/streaming/logging_config.py?ref=e438d8b7909eb6f6f0b45bac15dbd0c18688ffb1,https://api.github.com/repositories/1029766819/git/blobs/053dd4d34eb0957c7dc6a2c991a6780452dc39e2,https://github.com/JugalBili/speech-to-speech/blob/e438d8b7909eb6f6f0b45bac15dbd0c18688ffb1/src/streaming/logging_config.py,,,0,0,0,21,2025-08-21T01:09:44Z,1,0,"# Speech to Speech Pipeline

 This repo consists of a fully locally hosted AI voice assistant that transcribes speech in real time, processes natural conversations with a local LLM, and responds using realistic text-to-speech.

 There are 5 main components to this pipeline
 - Wake Word: Requires an activation word to start pipeline (e.g. ""Hey PicoVoice"")
 - STT: Transcribes your voice into text
 - Websearch + RAG: Search the web for info and store info in a RAG
 - LLM: Returns a responce to your prompt
 - TTS: Synthesizes LLM output to speech


![Pipeline Diagram](./images/pipeline.png)


