| `ANYSCALE_API_KEY` |  `Anyscale` Chat large language models.|
| `AZURE OPENAI_API_KEY` | `Azure OpenAI` Chat Completion API.|
| `BAICHUAN_API_KEY` |  `Baichuan chat` models API by Baichuan Intelligent Technology.|
