```bash
git clone https://github.com/LYiHub/psydraw.git
cd PsyDraw
```

2. Install dependencies:
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

3. Set up environment variables:
- Copy `.env_example` file and rename to `.env`
- Fill in your API key and base URL

