# Chinese-LangChain

> Chinese-LangChain：中文langchain项目，基于ChatGLM-6b+langchain实现本地化知识库检索与智能答案生成

https://github.com/yanqiangmiffy/Chinese-LangChain

俗称：小必应，Q.Talk，强聊，QiangTalk

