## 🗄️ Data Models

### Core Request/Response Types

```typescript
interface RecommendationRequest {
  audience: 'aapi' | 'latino' | 'black' | 'lgbtq'
  max_results?: number
}

interface OpportunityPlace {
  // AI-Generated Content
  opportunity_name: string
  brief_narrative: string
  cultural_narrative: string
  affordable_housing_narrative: string
  
  // Scoring & Assessment
  opportunity_score: number        // 0-100 AI-generated score
  opportunity_level: string        // ""High""/""Medium""/""Low""
  project_confidence: string       // Risk assessment
  affinity: number                // Qloo cultural affinity score
  
  // Actionable Insights
  estimated_timeline: string
  key_insights: string[]
  recommendations: string[]
  
  // Location Data
  name: string
  latitude: number
  longitude: number
  tags: string[]
}
```

### Agent State Management

```python
class AgentState(BaseModel):
    """"""Shared state across all LangGraph agents""""""
    audience: str
    max_results: int
    heatmap_points: List[HeatmapPoint]
    intersected_zones: List[Dict[str, Any]]
    places: List[Dict[str, Any]]
    opportunities: List[PlaceEntity]
    errors: List[str]
    zones_path: Optional[str]
```

