A production-ready Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot built with Pinecone vector database, OpenAI, and LangChain.

## Architecture

```
┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐
│   Document      │    │   Query Agent   │    │  Generation     │
│   Ingestion     │    │                 │    │  Agent          │
