34-semantic_chunker.py,study-template/34-semantic_chunker.py,034e2a79600b722d858c12ecb25f7162d254cdbd,lingduoduo/LLMOps,https://api.github.com/repositories/937449175/contents/study-template/34-semantic_chunker.py?ref=06c8f368f1fccc53bbb20ed98b84ae68e020a781,https://api.github.com/repositories/937449175/git/blobs/034e2a79600b722d858c12ecb25f7162d254cdbd,https://github.com/lingduoduo/LLMOps/blob/06c8f368f1fccc53bbb20ed98b84ae68e020a781/study-template/34-semantic_chunker.py,,,0,0,0,251,2025-09-07T20:35:12Z,1,1,"# LLMOps

### App Framework

```
|---app  // Application entry points collection
|   ├---__init__.py
|   └---http
|---config  // Application configuration files
|   ├---__init__.py
|   ├---config.py
|   └---default_config.py
|---internal  // All internal application directories
|   ├---core  // LLM core files, integrating LangChain, LLM, Embeddings, and other non-business logic code
|   |   |---agent  // Agent-related components
|   |   |---chain  // Chain-related logic
|   |   |---prompt  // Prompt templates and configurations
|   |   |---model_runtime  // LLM model runtime management
|   |   |---moderation  // Content moderation logic
|   |   |---tool  // Various tools and utilities
|   |   |---vector_store  // Vector database interactions
|   |   └---...
|   ├---exception  // Common exception handling
