### Use Different LLM

```python
# Llama 3 via Groq
llm = ChatGroq(api_key=os.environ.get(""GROQ_API_KEY""), model_name=""llama3-70b-8192"")

# OpenAI
llm = ChatOpenAI(model=""gpt-4o"")

# Claude
llm = ChatAnthropic(model=""claude-3-sonnet-20240229"")
```

