## 📚 Usage Examples

### Document Generation
```python
from rag_pipeline import HNCRAGPipeline

pipeline = HNCRAGPipeline()

# Generate a trust document
response = pipeline.generate_legal_document(
    document_type=""trust"",
    client_details={
        ""name"": ""John Doe"",
        ""id_number"": ""12345678"",
        ""address"": ""Nairobi, Kenya""
    },
    requirements=[
        ""Family trust for minor children"",
        ""Educational expense provisions"",
        ""Professional trustee appointment""
    ],
    custom_instructions=""Include university education funding provisions""
)

print(f""Generated document with {len(response.sources)} sources"")
print(f""Confidence: {response.confidence:.2f}"")
```

### Source Retrieval
```python
# Retrieve relevant legal sources
sources = pipeline.retrieve_relevant_sources(
    query=""trust formation requirements Kenya"",
    document_type=""kenya_statute"",
    k=5
)

for source in sources:
    print(f""{source.title}: {source.confidence:.2f}"")
```

