agent_builder.py,src/agent/agent_builder.py,3ccee379fa86e4120fa1df30d6c6c56ee6ed065b,stocchifra/LLM_Agent_Financial_Assistant,https://api.github.com/repositories/963217253/contents/src/agent/agent_builder.py?ref=27e5497f3ee0e82288124a430593bbdd71c263e6,https://api.github.com/repositories/963217253/git/blobs/3ccee379fa86e4120fa1df30d6c6c56ee6ed065b,https://github.com/stocchifra/LLM_Agent_Financial_Assistant/blob/27e5497f3ee0e82288124a430593bbdd71c263e6/src/agent/agent_builder.py,"A large language model (LLM)-powered agent designed to answer financial questions by analyzing data, tables, and figures. It supports both interactive chat and direct answer modes, integrating tools for arithmetic reasoning and financial data extraction. Built with modularity in mind, it supports models from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google.",,0,0,0,29,2025-05-07T10:28:10Z,0,0,"# Financial Assistant Agent Model

The goal of this project is to develop an LLM-powered agent capable of accurately answering financial questions by analyzing data, tables, and figures.

The model offers two main functionalities:

- **Chat mode:** Interactive conversation with integrated memory and context from previous messages.
- **Direct Answer mode:** Quick answers to questions without interactive chat.

---

